<properties>
    <!-- One row of properties per quest slot:
         {p}{i}_on    boolean  quest enabled
         {p}{i}_title string   quest text written by the user
         {p}{i}_cat   number   category index (0..4)
         The minimum active set (3 daily / 5 weekly / 10 monthly) ships
         enabled with neutral placeholder text so the app is populated on
         first run; the user replaces the text from the phone. -->
